# Installation Command
## Traditional Server(Docker-Compose) Environment
Install the Syncause data Agent in your business environment via a single command to capture real-time eBPF monitoring data from your Traditional services.
### Network
Confirm that your Syncause data Agent runtime environment can connect to the following ports on {{ ._server_addr_ }}：
30044、30310、30317、30319、30321、31363
### Deploy
CONFIG_FILE_URL="http://{{ ._server_addr_ }}:32364/api/integration/cluster/install/config?clusterId={{ ._cluster_id }}" bash -c "$(curl -fsSL "https://syncause.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/scripts-public/one-agent-deploy.sh")"
